                "message": "Fix generated C API headers for fused functions\n\nKeep valid legacy C identifiers in generated API headers. Look up functions\nusing the new type-based export keys first, with legacy fallback for older\nmodules. This fixes the regression introduced in GH-7656 while preserving\nits improved lookup behavior.\n\nAdd C/C++ regression coverage for scalar and const-pointer specializations,\nordinary exports, both export-name formats, new-key preference, reordered\nfused types, and missing or incompatible API entries.",
